Quiet settled flight still paid governed-combat resolve + speedLineDrive +
region + publishVelocityLanguage every tick at opacity/grain floor. Latch
after first silent publish; cheap speed/boost/physicsEarned dirty-wake.
Loading/photo-hide clear the latch so band-0 still publishes. Soft-GPU fps
not claimed. Picture unchanged (overlay already opacity 0).

Portable quiet microbench ~2.40× median (200k; floor minSpeedup ≥1.75×
across 4 package runs). Dirty-wake proved. Focused speed-lines+swing+
release-arc+uvp+cradle+law-heat+inactive+vfx-save+stroke-cache 32/32.
